## Why This Is Asked
Assess ability to design a scalable, multi-tenant AI moderation pipeline on AWS with policy-driven routing, data isolation, and compliant audit logging.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker multi-model endpoints and per-tenant routing
- DynamoDB for policy storage; S3 for audit logs and artifacts
- Tenant isolation via prefixes, IAM scoping, KMS encryption
- Step Functions for orchestration, error handling, retries
- Cost controls: autoscaling, model cache, off-peak scheduling

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-routing logic for tenant-aware inference
function routeToEndpoint(tenantId, itemType) {
  const policy = fetchPolicy(tenantId)
  if (itemType === 'image') return { endpoint: policy.imageEndpoint, threshold: policy.imageThreshold }
  return { endpoint: policy.textEndpoint, threshold: policy.textThreshold }
}
```

